/* --- The exported archive ------------------------------------------------
   The one output that leaves this app for good, and the only one that has to
   read well on a machine that has never heard of it. The FOLDER names inside
   the archive used to stay Finnish — "aani", "kuvat", "arkisto.json",
   "muistot.html" — on the argument that a name is format rather than prose and
   the prose around it is translated anyway. That argument held until 25 Sep
   2026, when the demo film drew the folder open name by name in front of a
   jury that watches it in English. They are English on every phone now
   (ArchiveExport.swift says why at length), and the same English everywhere,
   so two members of one family export archives that look alike. Only the prose
   below is translated; an archive exported before that day keeps its own names
   and its own page, and still opens, because nothing ever reads one back in. */
"Muistoarkisto" = "Memory archive";
"Viety %@." = "Exported %@.";
" Äänitiedostot ovat kansiossa <code>audio</code> ja kuvat kansiossa <code>photos</code>. Tiedosto <code>archive.json</code> sisältää kaiken koneluettavassa muodossa." = " The recordings are in the <code>audio</code> folder and the photographs in <code>photos</code>. The file <code>archive.json</code> holds everything in machine-readable form.";
"Huom:" = "Note:";
"Yksi kuva tai äänitys ei ollut saatavilla, kun tämä arkisto vietiin. Se on tallessa ja tulee mukaan seuraavaan vientiin." = "One photograph or recording was not available when this archive was exported. It is safe, and it will come with the next export.";
"%lld kuvaa tai äänitystä ei ollut saatavilla, kun tämä arkisto vietiin. Ne ovat tallessa ja tulevat mukaan seuraavaan vientiin." = "%lld photographs or recordings were not available when this archive was exported. They are safe, and they will come with the next export.";
"Ääni tallessa, tekstiä ei ole vielä kirjoitettu." = "The recording is kept; the text has not been written yet.";
"Ääni on tallessa, mutta ei ollut saatavilla tähän vientiin." = "The recording is kept, but it was not available for this export.";
"Vielä kysymättä" = "Still unasked";
"Ilman muistoja" = "Without memories";
